pacité de l’overlay GIF (normal et survol)",[23,1146,1148],{"id":1147},"enregistrer-et-partager","Enregistrer et partager",[35,1150,1151,1157,1163,1169],{},[38,1152,1153,1156],{},[18,1154,1155],{},"Exporter .css"," — écrire un fichier de thème à sauvegarder ou envoyer à un ami",[38,1158,1159,1162],{},[18,1160,1161],{},"Ajouter aux thèmes"," — enregistrer le fichier dans ton dossier Themes et l’appliquer",[38,1164,1165,1168],{},[18,1166,1167],{},"Importer .css"," — charger un preset intégré ou un thème enregistré",[38,1170,1171,1174],{},[18,1172,1173],{},"Réinitialiser"," — revenir aux défauts SoundNinja",[14,1176,1177],{},"Si tu fermes la fenêtre avec des changements non enregistrés, SoundNinja te demande d’enregistrer d’abord.",[23,1179,1181],{"id":1180},"sans-léditeur-complet","Sans l’éditeur complet",[14,1183,29,1184,1186],{},[18,1185,717],{}," tu peux toujours :",[35,1188,1189,1192,1198],{},[38,1190,1191],{},"Choisir un thème dans la liste",[38,1193,1194,1195,1112],{},"Éditer les variables CSS en direct (",[18,1196,1197],{},"CSS personnalisé",[38,1199,1200],{},"Importer un fichier de thème dans le dossier Themes",{"title":154,"searchDepth":155,"depth":155,"links":1202},[1203,1204,1205,1206],{"id":1096,"depth":155,"text":1097},{"id":1129,"depth":155,"text":1130},{"id":1147,"depth":155,"text":1148},{"id":1180,"depth":155,"text":1181},"Concevoir couleurs, polices, boutons et onglets dans le Theme Creator.",{},5,"\u002Ftheme-editor",{"title":1082,"description":1207},"theme-editor","wkR6rxJNnSmcJeJxDdslCOIyK7-9BblSMG_tJA6IwRY",{"id":4,"title":5,"body":1215,"description":161,"extension":162,"meta":1307,"navigation":164,"order":165,"path":166,"seo":1308,"stem":168,"__hash__":169},{"type":7,"value":1216,"toc":1301},[1217,1219,1223,1225,1229,1243,1245,1247,1265,1267,1279,1281,1289,1295],[10,1218,5],{"id":12},[14,1220,16,1221,21],{},[18,1222,20],{},[23,1224,26],{"id":25},[14,1226,29,1227,33],{},[18,1228,32],{},[35,1230,1231,1235,1239],{},[38,1232,1233,43],{},[18,1234,42],